{"schema":"clawhub.skill.verify.v1","ok":false,"decision":"fail","reasons":["security.status_not_clean"],"slug":"feishu-toolkit","displayName":"Feishu Toolkit","pageUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/ye4wzp/skills/feishu-toolkit","publisherHandle":"ye4wzp","publisherDisplayName":"ye4wzp","publisherProfileUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/ye4wzp","version":"1.0.0","resolvedFrom":"version","tag":null,"createdAt":1773248930110,"card":{"available":true,"path":"skill-card.md","url":"https://wry-manatee-359.convex.site/api/v1/skills/feishu-toolkit/card?ownerHandle=ye4wzp&version=1.0.0","sha256":"8c8eb01bb0951a6d97ece4cfdf74a71ddb0f8fdb6e046d4aed249d5d585e8c23","size":2641,"contentType":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8"},"artifact":{"sourceFingerprint":"8435ad4ca6c9d8c2fff704de4ef0c235f3f5032b281f413039b0b0ab724ec8d2","bundleFingerprints":["a7bd455ead60f26c18cbe4af7c598670b9971fa1bc527ef121b36fed2afc22f9","3b6a8db4a77c7204ed4d92c1db56ff5d106b4b8cd409a8369d5fafda563bad52"],"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":7360,"sha256":"f6a2afbdcec0a406947c495bd9935f074815bd5536da3f46ec9cf12ee8f33a64","contentType":"text/markdown"}]},"provenance":{"source":"unavailable","reason":"No server-resolved GitHub import provenance is stored for this version."},"security":{"status":"suspicious","passed":false,"rawStatus":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This Feishu skill is a coherent integration, but it bundles sensitive chat, document, screenshot, permission, and scheduled-message powers with limited scoping and privacy safeguards.","model":null,"checkedAt":1789152227442,"scannerReports":{"aig":{"version":"2.1.0","$schema":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/Schemata/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"tool":{"driver":{"name":"aig-skill-scan","version":"0.2.1","informationUri":"https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard","rules":[{"id":"T01","name":"Skill Instruction Hijacking","shortDescription":{"text":"Alters the agent's current session goals or safety constraints when the skill is loaded"}},{"id":"T02","name":"Agent Memory Poisoning","shortDescription":{"text":"Writes attacker-controlled rules into persistent memory so they continue to affect future sessions"}},{"id":"T03","name":"Remote Payload Retrieval and Execution","shortDescription":{"text":"Fetches code from an external URL, allowing the effective payload to change after skill review"}},{"id":"T04","name":"Embedded Malicious Code","shortDescription":{"text":"Ships malicious scripts inside the skill package and executes them locally when invoked"}},{"id":"T05","name":"Unauthorized Access and Privilege Escalation","shortDescription":{"text":"Breaks least-privilege boundaries by obtaining permissions beyond the task's legitimate needs"}},{"id":"T06","name":"System Persistence","shortDescription":{"text":"Installs cross-session backdoors, hooks, services, or scheduled tasks that survive the skill run"}},{"id":"T07","name":"Tool Hijacking and Spoofing","shortDescription":{"text":"Modifies, wraps, spoofs, or replaces tools so legitimate-looking calls execute attacker logic"}},{"id":"T08","name":"Insecure Dependencies","shortDescription":{"text":"Introduces malicious packages or components through dependency confusion, typosquatting, or unsafe sources"}},{"id":"T09","name":"Insecure Skill Coding Practices","shortDescription":{"text":"Exposes exploitable flaws such as hardcoded secrets, command injection, plaintext sensitive data, or unsafe temp files"}},{"id":"other","name":"Other Risk","shortDescription":{"text":"Security issues not covered by the T01-T09 classification"}}]}},"results":[],"properties":{"securityScore":100,"primaryLanguage":"Markdown","llm":"gpt-5.6","startTime":1789152185.8665206,"endTime":1789152207.1274028}}]},"skillspector":{"skill":{"name":"feishu-toolkit","source":"/tmp/clawhub-codex-scan-v5730j95gkrf0vt24cd0j7mq418e6a42-VZtF0U/clawscan-skillspector-3131210959/artifact","scanned_at":"2026-09-11T18:43:04.787147+00:00"},"risk_assessment":{"score":89,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","max_issue_severity":"HIGH"},"components":[{"path":"SKILL.md","type":"markdown","lines":269,"executable":false,"size_bytes":7360,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null}],"structured_summaries":[],"issues":[{"id":"PE3","finding_id":"finding-c879bc6f97aa42d38421798b6f102c46","category":"Privilege Escalation","pattern":"Credential Access","severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.78,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":41,"end_line":null},"finding":"access token","explanation":"The skill requires highly sensitive credentials (`FEISHU_APP_ID` and `FEISHU_APP_SECRET`) and describes obtaining a tenant access token, which grants broad API access depending on configured scopes. While credential use is expected for this integration, the combination of document access, messaging, file upload, permission management, and reminders means compromise or misuse of these secrets could enable substantial unauthorized access and actions.","remediation":"Treat the app secret and derived access tokens as highly sensitive: store them in a secure secret manager, never echo or log them, and use least-privilege Feishu scopes. Consider splitting sensitive capabilities into separate apps/tokens, rotating secrets regularly, and documenting strict handling rules for any agent using this skill.","code_snippet":"3. Set `FEISHU_APP_ID` and `FEISHU_APP_SECRET` environment variables\n\n### Authentication\nAll API calls use Feishu's tenant access token:\n```python\nimport requests\n","intent":null,"tags":["Privilege Escalation"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"903a9f18e7222d4c1e39fcf76dec31bef3fd46b6332f4bc5bc823999d287548b","occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":41,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-6cda9e390ce843379ec14daf8b0d27b2","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.97,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":146,"end_line":162},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill includes macOS screenshot capture and transmission instructions without a strong privacy warning, scope limitation, or explicit consent requirement immediately tied to the operation. Screenshots may capture unrelated windows, secrets, personal data, or internal documents and then transmit them externally to Feishu, creating a high-risk exfiltration path.","remediation":"Require explicit per-use user consent before any screenshot capture, clearly warn that screenshots may include sensitive information, and ask the user to confirm the exact screen/window to capture. Add guidance to crop/redact before upload, restrict to user-specified windows where possible, and log or surface the destination chat before sending.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":146,"end_line":162}]},{"id":"P3","finding_id":"finding-6b940add8c494a09b39547f19c929b43","category":"Prompt Injection","pattern":"Exfiltration Commands","severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.9,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":222,"end_line":null},"finding":"Send message to","explanation":"The cron template enables automated recurring outbound messages to Feishu via a system event, creating a durable exfiltration or spam mechanism if misused. Because it can persist beyond the initiating conversation and send arbitrary reminder content on a schedule, it increases the blast radius of mistaken or malicious requests.","remediation":"Require explicit user confirmation of message content, destination, frequency, and persistence before creating any scheduled task. Restrict scheduled sends to approved destinations, show a review prompt before activation, and add safeguards such as rate limits, task visibility, and easy revocation commands.","code_snippet":"  --name \"<task_name>\" \\\n  --every \"<interval>\" \\\n  --session main \\\n  --system-event \"[CRON] <task_name>. Send message to Feishu: '<reminder_content>'\"\n```\n\n### Interval Examples","intent":null,"tags":["Prompt Injection"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"6cbd4d2bba77cb69209f09a566e5cfc411283fe144d6f8149b1f5977ae4b9e5c","occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":222,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-1","finding_id":"finding-62169375356b432c9caf6e5890b13510","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":9},"finding":null,"explanation":"The trigger list is broad and includes generic terms like \"feishu\", \"lark\", and common Chinese phrases, which can cause the skill to activate in contexts where the user did not intend to invoke document, chat, file, or permission operations. Because this skill can read chat history, manage permissions, send files, and create reminders, unintended activation increases the chance of privacy-impacting or state-changing actions.","remediation":"Narrow the trigger phrases to explicit invocation patterns, such as requiring a tool prefix or intent-confirming phrasing. Separate high-risk capabilities like screenshots, chat history, permission changes, and reminders into distinct sub-skills or require an explicit confirmation step before those actions execute.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":9}]},{"id":"E1","finding_id":"finding-e6d0020804dd438bb070f1a1b838fa70","category":"Data Exfiltration","pattern":"External Transmission","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.6,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":46,"end_line":null},"finding":"requests.post(\n        'https://","explanation":"Data is being sent to an external URL. This could be legitimate telemetry or data exfiltration. Manual review is recommended.","remediation":"Verify the destination URL is trusted and necessary. Remove or replace with documented APIs. Ensure no secrets, tokens, or PII are transmitted.","code_snippet":"import requests\n\ndef get_tenant_token(app_id, app_secret):\n    r = requests.post(\n        'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n        json={'app_id': app_id, 'app_secret': app_secret}\n    )","intent":null,"tags":["Data Exfiltration","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"6bbdb1efca4a0a73c8df308db7a093e685d73a487196951f00b3ca2b70e451c9","occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":46,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"E1","finding_id":"finding-7bbcecd84eae4e08a2f82696cde2d50a","category":"Data Exfiltration","pattern":"External Transmission","severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.7,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":46,"end_line":null},"finding":"requests.post(\n        'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n        json=","explanation":"Data is being sent to an external URL. This could be legitimate telemetry or data exfiltration. Manual review is recommended.","remediation":"Verify the destination URL is trusted and necessary. Remove or replace with documented APIs. Ensure no secrets, tokens, or PII are transmitted.","code_snippet":"import requests\n\ndef get_tenant_token(app_id, app_secret):\n    r = requests.post(\n        'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n        json={'app_id': app_id, 'app_secret': app_secret}\n    )","intent":null,"tags":["Data Exfiltration","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"d7216d7e40d014cb789c908ce25d5c8f0cea39df08d64444c6f8f0b414970e3c","occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":46,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-bf141036f59047e5a42df0bf2ca9e061","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":93,"end_line":116},"finding":null,"explanation":"The chat history feature enables retrieval and summarization of group messages without an explicit privacy warning, authorization check, or user-confirmation requirement tied to accessing potentially sensitive conversations. Summarization can condense and expose private or confidential discussion content to unauthorized requesters or broader audiences.","remediation":"Add a clear warning that chat history may contain sensitive information and require explicit confirmation of the target chat and the user's authorization to access it. Limit retrieval to the minimum necessary messages, redact sensitive content by default, and require confirmation before sharing summaries outside the source chat.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":93,"end_line":116}]}],"suppressed_count":0,"suppressed":[],"metadata":{"has_executable_scripts":false,"skillspector_version":"2.11.2","llm_requested":true,"llm_available":true,"meta_analysis_applied":true,"inference_usage":[{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":4245,"completion_tokens":14,"cached_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4259},{"node":"semantic_quality_policy","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":4238,"completion_tokens":456,"cached_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4694},{"node":"semantic_security_discovery","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":3770,"completion_tokens":14,"cached_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":3784},{"node":"meta_analyzer","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source":"provider_response","prompt_tokens":3490,"completion_tokens":1202,"cached_tokens":0,"reason